stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Evidence
  Evidence --> Draft : map + weather horizon labelled
  Evidence --> Draft : no coordinates / weather unavailable
  Draft --> Check : LLM structured output
  Draft --> Fallback : model absent / error
  Check --> Ready : schema + names valid
  Check --> Fallback : invalid / ungrounded
  Fallback --> Ready : deterministic guidance
  Evidence --> Failed : map or memory error
  Ready --> [*] : proposal + provenance
  Failed --> [*] : workflow reports failure